Oneko / Neko Credits:

The cat sprite sheet (miu.gif) originates from the classic Neko / Oneko
desktop toy. The JavaScript implementation used as the basis for this project
is oneko.js by adryd325 (https://github.com/adryd325/oneko.js), licensed under
the MIT License.

The original Neko was created by Naoshi Watanabe (1989) for the NEC PC-9801.
The X11 port (xneko / oneko) was written by Tatsuya Kato and others.
The sprite artwork is considered public domain / freely distributable and has
been used in countless Neko derivatives since the early 1990s.
